  "notes": "Describes what something looks like, not its exact color, so it suits faded cloth, hazy skies, cloudy water and dusty surfaces.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {白|しろ}っぽく⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧: to turn whitish; to fade\n- {白|しろ}っぽい⟦{色|いろ}→色：00849_iro⟧: a whitish color\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{白|しろ}い→白い：00587_shiroi⟧: white — the plain color word\n- ⟦{赤|あか}っぽい→赤っぽい：33950_akappoi⟧, ⟦{黒|くろ}っぽい→黒っぽい：33956_kuroppoi⟧: reddish, blackish — the same pattern with other colors",
